zjg"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1rzurr3" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0m-3.97-3.03a.75.75 0 0 0-1.08.022L7.477 9.417 5.384 7.323a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L6.97 11.03a.75.75 0 0 0 1.079-.02l3.992-4.99a.75.75 0 0 0-.01-1.05z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4b2bf464-3bc1-47b8-91ea-662592da52ec" class="r-1j2waqc"><div data-rid="5fed270e-b26f-4b49-a12a-adf48696bdb0" class="r-4nrhvi"><picture data-rid="1991f00d-faa2-41c0-ad00-c9a7a0a046ef" class="r-mdltza"><img src="https://www.realskincare.com/cdn/shop/files/04_1.jpg?v=1682544658&amp;width=1200" class="r-zvgy7y" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="dc24a4ec-0394-4fdf-b6de-91dfdefaffce" class="r-o6cdy"><div data-rid="007ca695-e242-4a8d-85f3-3b672df6cd38" class="r-19bclu7 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c49f91ba-aca9-4261-b848-4be87709c9fd-styles-f08eae52-b16f-4fda-a294-1eacf25ec309-attributes-color:#212326"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why Coconut Oil Works Better Than Synthetic Moisturizers</p></span></div><div data-rid="aa85e332-35a7-4298-a112-76fbf25e95b1" class="r-1ijiwti alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most conventional lotions rely on petroleum-based fillers that sit on top of your skin. Coconut oil absorbs, nourishes, and supports your natural moisture barrier.</p></span></div><div data-rid="f42709ca-3f9c-4cf8-a43c-23325ddff2c0" class="r-1weh890"><div data-rid="39db8daa-1f3b-42bd-bec7-6d1e9b16d173" class="r-1o11dkr"><picture data-rid="09bae474-ee7d-4adf-8238-4f7a8585cad7" class="r-uuvkx0"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/fb7bebdc-b27a-4f8d-b660-73a12518a115/882c2e7d-f2c8-4821-95b0-4246e8fc0c00?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/fb7bebdc-b27a-4f8d-b660-73a12518a115/882c2e7d-f2c8-4